the 33 gates, 4 lines printed before the array is entered (`building chaos-verify:frozen`,
`preparing cargo cache volumes`, `source tree:`, `preflight:`, of which the last three are
preamble rather than gates) and 3 sub-headings that two gates print for themselves. In the
`--list` order, with those sub-headings indented:

